'''December Gauntlet''' (12月強襲！, ''12 Gatsu Kyōshū！'', '''December Assault!''') is a [[Gauntlet]] that only appears during December and was added in the [[Version 11.0 Update]]. It features enemies from the [[Jingle Cat Bell (Monthly Event)|Jingle Cat Bell]] event.

==Overview==
===About===
The December Gauntlet contains a total of 10 [[No Continues]] stages, called '''Jingle Cat Lvs''' (来た！ Lvs.). After beating three stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available). Rewards for the first completion of a Jingle Cat Lv can include [[Battle Items]], one Platinum Fragment and [[Ototo Corps|Catamins]]. The rewards reset with every appearance of the event.

===Stage Battlegrounds===
:''See [[December Gauntlet/Jingle Cat Lv.1~10]].''

==Play Requirements==
*December Gauntlet is unlocked after clearing [[Jingle Cat Bell (Monthly Event)|Jingle Cat Bell]].

